<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Cellular started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Cellular started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of U.S. Cellular Corp as a market performer and set a 1997 year-end price target of $33 a share.</p>
<p>-- said U.S. Cellular has opportunity to realize above average subscriber growth.</p>
<p>-- said stock is realtively expensive to its peers &quot;on some measures.&quot;</p>
<p>-- U.S. Cellular lost 1/8 to 27-7/8.</p>
</text>
